tion III has no solution."}] [{:db/id 17592186256427 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id 17592186115222 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "80449399-3ae4-593f-8c3b-00bcdcc99727" :knowledge-point/title "Solving Trigonometric Equations Outside of the Range of Cosecant"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9ea0f9e5-6ff5-59fe-9529-c971786bf12f" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "II and III only" :db/id 17592186255067} {:answer/id #uuid "a17ade41-98aa-506c-9ec8-1af48400efa4" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "III only" :db/id 17592186255091} {:answer/id #uuid "ccec92a2-4176-5f0e-98b9-9281024e3dd9" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "I only" :db/id 17592186255491} {:answer/id #uuid "ed2b7028-aa27-5a01-beb8-3f8ffb9bd8bc" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "II only" :db/id 17592186255743} {:answer/id #uuid "f87c9d22-4ab8-5daf-8288-8a1a9b1698c4" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "I and II only" :db/id 17592186255847}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9ea0f9e5-6ff5-59fe-9529-c971786bf12f" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "II and III only" :db/id 17592186255067} :answer-field/id #uuid "72c5ea8d-a1d9-59db-9579-c5215f6b9e23" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id 17592186256128}] :question/difficulty {:db/id 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "054ed097-32f2-5e6d-8799-43d62b3579f5" :question/math-academy-id "q-120608" :question/problem "Which of the following equations has no solutions for $0\\le x<2\\pi ?$\n\n- $\\operatorname{csc}⁡x=-2$\n- $\\operatorname{csc}⁡x=\\frac{1}{4}$\n- $\\operatorname{csc}⁡x=-\\frac{3}{5}$" :question/worked-solution "Recall that the range of $\\