B∨A) \\\\  & ≡¬B≢A.\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Statement II is logically equivalent to $A.$ We have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(¬B∨A)∧A & ≡A∧(¬B∨A) \\\\  & ≡A∧(A∨¬B) \\\\  & ≡A.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Statement III is logically equivalent to $A.$ We have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A∧(¬B∨A) & ≡A∧(A∨¬B) \\\\  & ≡A.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only.\""}] [{:db/id 17592186378202 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id 17592186157274 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "4106fe70-b9df-5621-ba64-66703855aaf9" :knowledge-point/title "Simplifying an Expression Using the Law that Conjunction Absorbs Disjunction"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ba3b1751-5953-5fca-8888-36a7a3297a4c" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "II and III only" :db/id 17592186378204} {:answer/id #uuid "f02ab0f2-8c8d-5fd8-963f-d04a3c8c656b" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "III only" :db/id 17592186378205} {:answer/id #uuid "0feae2e8-2525-5ecf-8d7d-7e68e9b38b6d" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "I and II only" :db/id 17592186378206} {:answer/id #uuid "2f9e9ac1-3a4c-54fa-9933-143e3aab6af8" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "I, II and III" :db/id 17592186378207} {:answer/id #uuid "debc70be-b144-586f-87cd-0bea5ee97e0f" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "II only" :db/id 17592186378208}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ba3b1751-5953-5fca-8888-36a7a3297a4c" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "II and III only" :db/id 17592186378204} :answer-field/id #uuid "6f67a62a-6a40-51ca-bcf5-0c92f198f397" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id 17592186378203}] :question/difficulty {:db/id 17592186045487 :d